      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The logic of your pain is a trap, but your desire to stop hurting them is a sign of deep love, not a justification for ending your life. You are not a weight; you are the anchor holding them together when everything else is falling apart. Please, do not make the decision to disappear based on a calculation that ignores the complex reality of your situation. There is a way to be present and helpful without being a burden, but you cannot find it alone.",
